select '1a19036f-b7d9-516a-b144-95bbf8270b4f', e.id, 'IN', (select id from public.content_components where code = 'IN.P6'), 'qa_passed', 'cefr_part', '{"title":"Cooler cities","text":"On a sunny afternoon, the centre of a large city can be several degrees hotter than the countryside around it. Scientists call this an \"urban heat island\". It happens because materials like concrete and asphalt absorb heat during the day and release it slowly at night. Cars, air conditioners and factories add even more heat.\n\nThis is not just a question of comfort. Very high temperatures can be dangerous for older people and small children, and they increase the amount of electricity a city uses. In some places, hot nights also make the air more polluted.\n\nCities around the world are trying different solutions. Medellín, for example, created a network of \"green corridors\" by planting trees and plants along roads and streams. Officials say temperatures in some of those areas have fallen by around two degrees. Other cities paint roofs white so that they reflect sunlight instead of absorbing it.\n\nHowever, experts warn that trees need years to grow and must be looked after. Planting them is the easy part; making sure they survive is much harder. A green corridor that is forgotten after the opening ceremony will not cool anyone.","svg":null,"table":null}'::jsonb, 'What does the example of Medellín show?', '[{"label":"A","text":"Streams make cities hotter.","is_correct":false,"distractor_type":"Interpreta mal la mención de quebradas.","explanation_feedback":"Incorrecta. Las quebradas son lugares donde sembraron, no causas del calor."},{"label":"B","text":"Trees grow faster in Colombia.","is_correct":false,"distractor_type":"Inventa una afirmación.","explanation_feedback":"Incorrecta. El texto no habla de la velocidad de crecimiento en Colombia."},{"label":"C","text":"White roofs are the best solution.","is_correct":false,"distractor_type":"Atribuye a Medellín la otra solución.","explanation_feedback":"Incorrecta. Los techos blancos son de «other cities»."},{"label":"D","text":"Planting vegetation can lower temperatures.","is_correct":true,"distractor_type":null,"explanation_feedback":"Correcta. Los corredores verdes habrían reducido la temperatura unos dos grados en algunas zonas."}]'::jsonb, 'B1', 1.3, 1.3, 0.25, 90, 'original_generated'
