select '8c9f9472-252f-54e5-8701-112e29a34351', e.id, 'IN', (select id from public.content_components where code = 'IN.P6'), 'qa_passed', 'cefr_part', '{"title":"Water for Uribia","text":"When Laura Pushaina finished her engineering degree in Barranquilla, most of her classmates took jobs in big companies. Laura went back to Uribia, in La Guajira, where she grew up. \"In my community, children walk for hours to collect water that is often not safe to drink,\" she explains. \"I studied engineering because I wanted to change that.\"\n\nWith a small team of volunteers, Laura designed a system that collects rainwater from the roofs of schools and stores it in large tanks. Because it doesn''t rain often in La Guajira, every drop matters, so the system also includes simple filters made with sand and charcoal. The first tank was installed at a primary school three years ago. Today there are eleven.\n\nThe project has not been easy. At the beginning, some families did not trust the water, and two tanks were damaged during a storm. Laura decided to train local young people to repair and clean the systems themselves. \"If the community doesn''t own the project, it will die when we leave,\" she says. Now a group of fifteen teenagers looks after the tanks, and some of them are planning to study engineering too.","svg":null,"table":null}'::jsonb, 'Which sentence best describes Laura?', '[{"label":"A","text":"An engineer interested mainly in money.","is_correct":false,"distractor_type":"Contradice su decisión.","explanation_feedback":"Incorrecta. Dejó de lado empleos en grandes empresas para ayudar a su comunidad."},{"label":"B","text":"Someone who prefers working alone.","is_correct":false,"distractor_type":"Contradice el texto.","explanation_feedback":"Incorrecta. Trabaja con voluntarios y jóvenes de la comunidad."},{"label":"C","text":"Someone who gives up when things go wrong.","is_correct":false,"distractor_type":"Contradice su reacción.","explanation_feedback":"Incorrecta. Ante los problemas, buscó soluciones como formar a los jóvenes."},{"label":"D","text":"A practical person who thinks about the long term.","is_correct":true,"distractor_type":null,"explanation_feedback":"Correcta. Diseñó una solución sencilla y buscó que la comunidad la mantuviera en el futuro."}]'::jsonb, 'B1', 1.3, 1.3, 0.25, 90, 'original_generated'
